  <div>
    <h3>_(Vast.ai Dashboard Widget Configuration)_</h3>
    <p>_(Monitor your listed Vast.ai machines, active rentals, real-time hourly income, and hardware telemetry right on the Unraid Dashboard.)_</p>
  </div>
</div>

<form markdown="1" method="POST" action="/update.php" target="progressFrame">
<input type="hidden" name="#file" value="vastai/vastai.cfg">

_(Vast.ai API Key)_:
: <div class="vast-input-group">
    <input type="password" id="vast_api_key_field" name="API_KEY" style="width: 380px;" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($api_key, ENT_QUOTES)?>" placeholder="_(Enter your Vast.ai API Key)_" required>
    <button type="button" class="button" onclick="toggleApiKeyVisibility()"><i id="vast_eye_icon" class="fa fa-eye"></i></button>
    <button type="button" class="button" id="vast_btn_test" onclick="testVastConnection()">_(Test Connection)_</button>
